title: Psalms 41–43: He That Considereth the Poor, and Why Art Thou Cast Down?
description: Psalms 41-43 in the King James Bible: blessed is he that considereth the poor, confession before petition, the familiar friend that lifted up his heel, as the hart panteth after the water brooks, deep calleth unto deep, and hope thou in God, from the Psalms series studies.
output: lessons/bible/psalms-41-43.html
context: yes

